flowchart TD
    A[Refurbished Sale] --> B[Create weekly InstallmentPlan]
    B --> C[Generate dated InstallmentSchedule rows]
    C --> D[Reserve exact RefurbishedUnit]
    D --> E[Receive weekly payment]
    E --> F[PaymentTransaction + PaymentAllocation]
    F --> G[InstallmentSettlement allocations]
    G --> H{All plan amounts settled?}
    H -->|No| E
    H -->|Yes, LAYAWAY| I[Authorize handover]
    I --> J[Consume stock / mark unit SOLD]
    H -->|Early handover requested| K{CREDIT_SALE legal gate approved?}
    K -->|No| L[Reject early handover]
    K -->|Yes| M[Authorize credit-sale handover]
    M --> J
